      "title": "RoBERTa: A Robustly Optimized BERT Pretraining Approach",
      "author": "Yinhan Liu, Myle Ott, Naman Goyal, Jingfei Du, Mandar Joshi, Danqi Chen, Omer Levy, Mike Lewis, Luke Zettlemoyer, Veselin Stoyanov",
      "year": "2019",
      "publisher": "",
